<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 450 mln tenge bills June 2.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 450 mln tenge bills June 2.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 450 million tenge of 12-month MKM discount Treasury bills on June 2, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the 12-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ4CK0406983</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   450 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    364 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     June 2</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  June 4, 1998</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
